  "releaseNotes": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 272753b5ad50b6c49afd3d2669a8c9563473b19b -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Document release publication workflow (#29) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/39\n* feat: add exhaustive container coverage checks for layer templates by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/40\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add direct and transitive dependency modes (#14) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/41\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add external dependency contracts (#15) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/42\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add ignored-violation unmatched alerting (#16) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/43\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add recursive acyclic sibling contracts by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/48\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add conditional compilation analysis modes by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/49\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add validation timing baseline harness (#50) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/52\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add automatic baseline generation (#44) by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/53\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add namespace glob patterns by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/54\n* [TASK][DOCS] Documentation: Rework README and MkDocs information architecture by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/68\n* [TASK][AI] Tooling: Add method body scanning to external dependency contracts by @eugenemalaschuk-source in https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/pull/78\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eugenemalaschuk-source/arch-linter-net/compare/v0.1.0-preview.4...v0.1.0",
